<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY QINGJIAN</view><view class="title">{{viewer.role==='student'?'我的运动档案':'我的教学空间'}}</view><demo-notice/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="refresh">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载档案…</view>
<block wx:if="{{!loading}}"><view class="card hero"><view class="row"><view class="avatar">{{viewer.role==='student'?'生':'师'}}</view><view class="grow"><view class="name">{{student?student.name:viewer.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{student?'稳定学生ID：'+student.student_id:'课堂管理与教学分析'}}</view></view><text class="pill" bindtap="identity">切换身份</text></view><view class="hint">{{student?'档案跟随已确认的学生身份积累，不使用临时人体跟踪编号。':'从全班状态到个别反馈，让指导更有依据。'}}</view></view>
<block wx:if="{{student}}"><view class="grid"><view class="card"><view class="muted">最近统计窗口</view><view class="big">{{summary.count}}<text class="unit">次</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="muted">近期平均质量</view><view class="big">{{summary.average}}<text class="unit">分</text></view></view></view><view class="section">本次训练</view><view class="card" bindtap="report"><view class="row"><text class="name">深蹲专项训练</text><text class="link">查看报告 ›</text></view><view class="report-numbers"><view><view class="big">{{student.reps}}<text class="unit">/ {{student.target_reps}} 次</text></view><view class="muted">完成次数</view></view><view><view class="big">{{student.score}}<text class="unit">分</text></view><view class="muted">动作质量</view></view></view></view></block>
<view class="section">课前准备</view><view class="card row"><view><view class="name">课表与动作示范</view><view class="muted">先看课程安排，再熟悉练习动作</view></view><text class="link" bindtap="schedule">查看课表 ›</text></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="tutorials">观看原项目动作示范视频</button><view class="section">{{student?'记录与成长':'教学与管理'}}</view><view class="card menu-card"><view wx:if="{{student}}" class="list-row row" bindtap="trend"><view><view class="name">历史成绩与趋势</view><view class="muted">评分变化与重复动作问题</view></view><text class="link">›</text></view><view wx:else="" class="list-row row" bindtap="classroom"><view><view class="name">班级学生档案</view><view class="muted">通过课堂名单查看学生详情</view></view><text class="link">›</text></view><view wx:if="{{!student}}" class="list-row row" bindtap="statistics"><view><view class="name">班级统计与教学分析</view><view class="muted">分数分布、参与情况与共性问题</view></view><text class="link">›</text></view><view class="list-row row" bindtap="advice"><view><view class="name">{{student?'我的个性化训练建议':'AI辅助教学建议'}}</view><view class="muted">先展示依据，再给出训练重点</view></view><text class="link">›</text></view><view class="list-row row" bindtap="history"><view><view class="name">{{student?'历史训练记录':'历史课堂查询'}}</view><view class="muted">按记录回顾训练表现</view></view><text class="link">›</text></view><view class="list-row row" bindtap="system"><view><view class="name">设备与数据来源</view><view class="muted">FPGA / RK / 网络接入</view></view><text class="link">›</text></view></view><view class="hint">正式服务中，学生仅访问自己的记录，教师仅访问授权班级。权限由后端执行。</view></block></view>
